{"title":"It&#8217;s Happening: More Signs of Life From Boards of Canada","link":"https://kottke.org/26/04/its-happening-more-signs-of-life-from-boards-of-canada","date":1776261000000,"content":"\n         \t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1776259968-c7f66feb.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1776259968-c7f66feb.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1776259968-c7f66feb.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1776259972-5aacb1a3.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1776259972-5aacb1a3.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1776259972-5aacb1a3.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p>I reported last week that <a href=\"https://kottke.org/26/04/0048699-resident-advisor-there-ar\">signs of activity have been detected from Boards of Canada</a> in the form of mysterious VHS tapes sent out to fans. Yesterday, the group’s record label <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DXHH7TKjUtE/\">posted a bunch of photos</a> of posters hung up in cities around the world (NYC, Tokyo, LA) that match BoC’s style. First new album since 2013’s Tomorrow’s Harvest? Let’s hope so!\n</p>\n \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Boards%20of%20Canada\">Boards of Canada</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/music\">music</a></p>\n        \n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"de35254cfe80c2afaf803fb2acbbb9ff16c06380ac19e5c0378759320915fa18","category":"Sites"}